ck L calf\n                       daily obs.\n                       Continue med for a week then PRN\n                       Investigate possible need of other services\n                       Hygiene self managed\n\n\n\n\nWriting Task\nYou are the charge nurse on the hospital ward where Mr. Jones has recently\nhad his operation.\n\nUsing the information provided in the case notes, write a referral letter to the\nCommunity Nurse Supervisor at the Community Nursing Centre, Ashfield,\nwho will be attending to Mr. Jones following his discharge.\n\nIn your answer:\n\n   Expand the relevant case notes into complete sentences.\n\n   Do not use note form.\n\n   The body of the letter should be approximately 200 words.\n\n   Use correct letter format.", "pages": [{"number": 1, "text": "www.online-english-tutors.com\n\n                            Occupational English Test Practice Papers\n\n\n\n\nWriting Test 1 – Nurses\nTime allowed: 40 minutes\nRead the case notes below and complete the writing task which follows.\nHospital            Royal Prince Alfred Hospital\n\n\nPatient Details     Alexander Jones\n                    65 years old\n                    Marital status: divorced\n                    Next of kin: No living relatives –\n                    Ex wife to be contacted in case of emergency:\n                    Sandra Jones, 59 William Crescent, Smithtown\n                    0415 835 565\n\nAdmission Date      10/05/06\n\nDischarge Date      10/06/06\n\nDiagnosis           Basal cell carcimona L calf\n\nPast Medical        No prior hospitalizations, no known allergies, no known\nHistory             medications\n\nSocial              Retired postman,\nHistory/Supports    Lives alone: rented flat\n                    Age pension\n                    Hobbies: running, swimming, weight training, music,\n                    movies\n                    Regular exercise\n                    Smoker, <10 cigs per day\n                    Drinks: beer only <5 per d